// Custom Biome plugin: guard the determinism contract of the simulation.
//
// src/shared/sim.ts runs in three places (authoritative server tick, client
// prediction, client reconciliation re-runs). step() MUST be a pure function
// of (world, inputs): the same tick re-run on any machine must produce byte
// identical state. Wall-clock reads and unseeded randomness break that.
//
// This plugin is scoped to src/shared/sim.ts via `overrides` in biome.json.
// If you legitimately need time, feed it in as a tick. If you need randomness
// (block layout, powerup drops), use a seeded PRNG whose seed lives in
// WorldState.

language js

or {
  `Date.now()`,
  `performance.now()`,
  `new Date($...)`,
  `Math.random()`
} as $nondeterministic where {
  register_diagnostic(
    span = $nondeterministic,
    message = "sim.step() must be a pure function of (world, inputs): no wall-clock reads or Math.random(). Time enters the simulation only as ticks; randomness comes from a seeded PRNG whose seed lives in WorldState.",
    severity = "error"
  )
}
